{"data": [{"author_id": "128242953", "created_at": "2026-11-12T21:46:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120996580081996183"], "id": "2120996580081996183", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "我本身做30f级别线段，一般上升或下跌过程中只做两段5f级别\n懂缠论的肯定能听懂！\n仅供参考！", "url": "https://x.com/chanluntime/status/2120996580081996183"}, {"author_id": "1879736704128716800", "created_at": "2026-11-12T20:50:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120982536373584359"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 54, "id": "10228272", "start": 46, "username": "YouTube"}], "urls": [{"description": "Enjoy the videos and music you love, upload original content, and share it all with friends, family, and the world on YouTube.", "display_url": "youtube.com/shorts/2bXgw2o…", "end": 42, "expanded_url": "https://youtube.com/shorts/2bXgw2oB5jk?si=_ciDwUUKRg5pMOc5", "start": 19, "status": 200, "title": "🌸 佛法智慧｜《金刚经》：三心不可得", "unwound_url": "https://www.youtube.com/shorts/2bXgw2oB5jk?si=_ciDwUUKRg5pMOc5", "url": "https://t.co/O6FPejWPVZ"}]}, "id": "2120982536373584359", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🌸 佛法智慧｜《金刚经》：三心不可得 https://t.co/O6FPejWPVZ 来自 @YouTube\n\n🌸 佛法智慧｜《金刚经》：三心不可得\n\n《金刚经》说：\n\n过去心不可得，\n现在心不可得，\n未来心不可得。\n\n为什么三种心都不可得？\n\n第一，过去心不可得。\n\n昨天发生的事情，\n无论快乐还是痛苦，\n都已经过去。", "url": "https://x.com/sun780500/status/2120982536373584359"}, {"author_id": "3725964072", "created_at": "2026-11-12T21:48:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120996714685276596", "2120997112531816872"], "id": "2120997112531816872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 585, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "马眼和屁眼一起高潮吧！可爱的北海道男娘\n\n雪还在下。北海道的夜，像一封没有寄出的信，被风折了角，静静落在温泉旅馆的廊檐上。我从浴室出来，热气还缠在肩上，廊下的木板凉得发硬。忽然看见光——不是走廊灯，是从储物间半掩的门缝里漏出来的，细细的一条。\n门没锁。我推开一点，看见他。", "url": "https://x.com/PSbassguide/status/2120997112531816872"}, {"author_id": "3725964072", "created_at": "2026-11-12T21:46:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120996714685276596", "2120997112531816872"], "id": "2120996714685276596", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 74, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "马眼和屁眼一起高潮吧！\n\n雪还在下。北海道的夜，像一封没有寄出的信，被风折了角，静静落在温泉旅馆的廊檐上。我从浴室出来，热气还缠在肩上，廊下的木板凉得发硬。忽然看见光——不是走廊灯，是从储物间半掩的门缝里漏出来的，细细的一条。\n门没锁。我推开一点，看见他。", "url": "https://x.com/PSbassguide/status/2120996714685276596"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "128242953", "name": "一本缠", "username": "chanluntime"}, {"id": "1879736704128716800", "name": "與佛同行 Walking with the Buddha", "username": "sun780500"}, {"id": "3725964072", "name": "51小鱼 die系匹配", "username": "PSbassguide"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2120997112531816872", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzovch2avzwqw1ypd8ljr3klbi1rx", "oldest_id": "2120982536373584359", "result_count": 4}}
